    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51199" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vī^trum</span></b> , i, n.
		root in video, to see, as transparent; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 36,
				26, 65, § 191</span></i>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>glass.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 36,
				26, 65, § 189</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Rab.
				Post. 14, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Q. N. 1, 6, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 21, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 4</span></i>
			(5), 8, 37: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">O fons Bandu siae, splendidior vitro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 13, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 18, 16</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bassa, bibis vitro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					1, 38, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 15,
			157</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Woad</i>, a plant used for dyeing blue: Isatis
			tinctoria, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				5, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 3, 6, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 6,
				27, § 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">37, 8, 37, §
			117</span></i>.</div>
